---
layout: base.njk
---
<section class="blog-hero">
  <p class="eyebrow">NOTES FROM THE OTHER HALF</p>
  <h1>Software, cloud &amp; the occasional homelab adventure.</h1>
  <p>Written by <a href="https://kmoberg.no">Karl Mathias Moberg</a> — photographer by passion, technologist by trade, in Stavanger, Norway.</p>
</section>

<section class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
  <a class="row" href="{{ post.url }}">
    <time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
    <span class="post-title">{{ post.data.title }}</span>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
